 and 95% CIs were calculated with p<0.05 considered statistically significant\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"95% CIs that exclude 1 were considered statistically significant\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}